This automated cloud infrastructure provisioner is designed using modern C# (.NET 8). It features asynchronous, non-blocking parallel execution of independent resource nodes, dynamic scheduling via standard Task-based dependency tracing, and robust graph-validation capabilities (detecting cycles and missing dependencies).

---

### Architecture Overview

```
                  ┌───────────────────────────────┐
                  │   Infrastructure JSON Spec    │
                  └───────────────┬───────────────┘
                                  │
                                  ▼
                  ┌───────────────────────────────┐
                  │  Declarative Resource Parser  │
                  └───────────────┬───────────────┘
                                  │
                                  ▼
                  ┌───────────────────────────────┐
                  │  Dependency Graph Resolver   │
                  │ (Cycle detection & Validation)│
                  └───────────────┬───────────────┘
                                  │
                                  ▼
                  ┌───────────────────────────────┐
                  │   Parallel Execution Engine   │
                  │ (Asynchronous Task-Graph Scheduler)
                  └───────────────────────────────┘
```

